OL,3,AUnnamed celebrity accused of
OL,4,A'inappropriate sexual activities',
OL,5,Acourt hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA celebrity has asked the High Court to
OL,8,Fprevent two news organisations from
OL,9,Fpublishing his identity and allegations
OL,10,Fthat he abused his status for many
OL,11,Fyears to engage, or attempt to engage,
OL,12,Fin "inappropriate sexual activities
OL,13,Fwith a large number of girls and young
OL,14,Fwomen".
OL,16,FThe unnamed celebrity is seeking an
OL,17,Finjunction, and his legal team told the
OL,18,Ffirst day of a trial on Tuesday that
OL,19,Fany publication would be "highly
OL,20,Flikely" to lead him to kill himself.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
